  "compendium": {
    "gid": "441434520",
    "rowKey": "Praxic Blade\nTechnically-Not-A-Lightsaber\n\nRanged Weapon\nCormorant Reversal\nCormorant Combo",
    "section": "Kinetic Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Special Ammo Shield-Piercing Lightsaber Sword\nModifiable Tangs, Grips, Traits, Mods, and Catalysts.\nDeals 50% increased damage towards Combatant Shields, and 200% increased damage towards Barrier Shields.\nDefensive Form for base damage values against Elites, as it has no damage bonuses.\n\n[Light Attack] performs a Melee Combo, with each hit dealing 479 [256] Kinetic Damage. Melee Attacks can discharge Bolt Charge.\nUsing [Heavy Attack] after performing 3 [Light Attacks] executes a Cormorant Combo.\nCormorant Combo deals 689 [368] Kinetic Damage, followed by 3 damage instances of 417 [220] Kinetic Damage each, totalling 1940 [☠️] damage.\n\n[Heavy Attack Press] performs a Ranged Attack, throwing the blade forward up to 50 meters away, homing towards up to 3 enemies before returning.\nDeals 945 [174] Kinetic Damage per hit. Damage is reduced by 80% when returning. Attacking recalls the blade.\n\n[Heavy Attack Hold] throws the blade on a straight path forward, dealing 100% increased damage. [Heavy Attack Release] to recall the blade.\n\n[Blocking] grants 100% [~46%] Damage Resist against all damage in a ?° cone.\nBlocking a hit retaliates by reflecting a Crystal-Color Matching Bolt that deals 255 [50] Kinetic Damage towards the reticle.\n\n-------------\n\nBalanced Form | Scoring 3 Melee Attack Kills within 5 seconds of each grants +1 Ammo, restores 65 HP, and begins Health Regeneration. \nDeals 10% increased damage against Rank-and-File and Elite Combatants. Technically 11.2% due to impact stat shift.\n\nDefensive Form | Blocking an attack within 1 seconds of beginning to block grants 20% increased damage for 2 seconds.\nBlocking ? attacks within ? seconds of each attack grants +1 Ammo, up to once per second.\n\nOffensive Form | Scoring 3 damage instances within ? seconds of each grants +1 Ammo.\nDeals 15% increased damage against Bosses and Vehicles.",
